 "spoon-key", "explanation": "A spoon and a key can both be made from metal. We group objects by a property or material.", "wrongFeedback": "Group objects using their material. A spoon and key can both be metal."}};const names={"africa": "Africa", "antarctica": "Antarctica", "asia": "Asia", "europe": "Europe", "north-america": "North America", "south-america": "South America", "australia": "Australia", "pacific": "Pacific Ocean", "atlantic": "Atlantic Ocean", "indian": "Indian Ocean", "southern": "Southern Ocean", "arctic": "Arctic Ocean"};const errors=[],rows=[];page.on('pageerror',e=>errors.push(e.message));
